# Coordinating Civil Procedure with Legal Research and Writing: A Field Experiment.

**Authors:** Glannon, Joseph W., Seligmann, Terry Jean, Sichko, Medb Mahony, Simard, Linda Sandstrom

## Abstract
Describes a year-long collaboration to teach legal research and writing alongside civil procedure. In fall, civil procedure topics were used for writing assignments, in combination with simulation and demonstration exercises based on that case. In spring, students wrote briefs on motions to dismiss and motions for summary judgment in a second case while studying the same issues in civil procedure. (MSE)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ555733

